matting action.\n- In note edits proposed by the AI Assistant are now clearer: choose to see only the original text, only the changed text, or both, with changes highlighted word by word instead of large red and green blocks.\n- MCP can now read internal links, such as header links.\n\n🛠️ Fixes:\n- On Evernote Web, the browser tab now shows the open note's title.\n- Completed reminders in the note list now appear greyed out.\n- PDF, print, and HTML export now respect the strikethrough checklist setting.\n- Dates now follow your relative dates setting as soon as the app starts.\n- Fixes on Template imports and Meeting detection\n- Transcription made more reliable","tags":["9wzdncrfj3mb","ai-assistant","artificial-intelligence-assistant","calendar","checklist","collaborate","collaboration","list","memo","memorandum","notes","schedule","task","to-do","todo"]},"zh-CN":{"copyright":"© 2019 - 2026 Evernote Corporation。保留所有权利。","description":"在一处记住所有内容，并通过笔记、任务和日程处理一切。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Evernote 可帮助您专注于最重要的事情，并在需要时获取信息。输入打字笔记或扫描手写笔记，添加待办事项、照片、图片、网页或音频……并且所有内容都可即时搜索。以任何方式组织笔记，并与任何人共享。Evernote 还能在您的设备间同步，让你的信息随时随地与你同在。","tags":["任务","列表","协作","协同","备忘","备忘录","待办","待办事项","提醒事项","日历","日程","清单","笔记"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://help.evernote.com/","publisherUrl":"https://evernote.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"a4a78ef7dd5a1ec000e60392173b33bed55f7cbb","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/Evernote/Evernote/11.41.9/Evernote.Evernote.installer.yaml","sha256":"fed26cb6f17c883e2d1442d553e76d97ad7a93cfd24db66c5d4c589d39d55662"},{"path":"manifests/e/Evernote/Evernote/11.41.9/Evernote.Evernote.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"1c44051788d0596499c19e8d827043e8796ff8946ed27296064aafd38225f3f3"},{"path":"manifests/e/Evernote/Evernote/11.41.9/Evernote.Evernote.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"d9c6edde856e47f6cdf5c14cd23403cbbd15faccb681cb2c9faec4d